Clock Plan
TAC5112: Clock controller
NRF54L15: Clock target
Sample clock / FSYNC: 44.1 kHz, generated by codec
I2S format: Two 16-bit slots per frame
Bit clock / BCLK: 1.4112 MHz: 44,100 x 2 x 16
Audio content: Mono guitar signal in both slots
Codec reference clock: External oscillator (Exact frequency and configuration TBD)
Long-term synchronization: Receiver firmware resamples slightly to compensate for transmitter/receiver clock drift
